atom	transferred	from one of two equal magnitudes somewhat has been taken and added to the other
atom	exceeds_twice	the latter exceeds the former by twice that portion
atom	only_taken	the portion had been merely taken from the former and not added to the latter
atom	exceeds_once	the latter would have exceeded the former only by that one portion
atom	greater_exceeds_mean	the greater exceeds the mean by one portion
atom	mean_exceeds_less	the mean exceeds by one portion that magnitude from which the portion was taken
atom	add_to_less	the excess of the mean over the less is added to the less
atom	take_from_greater	the excess of the greater over the mean is taken from the greater
